# ----------------------------------------------------------
# Supabase PostgreSQL (session pooler — port 6543)
# ----------------------------------------------------------
# Format:
# postgresql://postgres.[project-ref]:[password]@[host]:6543/postgres?sslmode=require
#
# Where to find these values:
#   1. Go to https://supabase.com → your project
#   2. Settings → Database → Connection string → URI
#   3. Make sure you pick the "Session pooler" tab (port 6543)
#   4. Replace [queenoffheart01] with your DB password


